    "notes": "A Drowned South bandit who has heard the stories: the Stewards take prisoners — alive ones. Ambushes with one eye on the exit and the other on the REFORMED column outside the Muster. The current Road Bandit build (2026-10-13); spawns in the ambushes that come after the first, as the Bandit Accord unfolds.",
